& \theta=\frac{\pi}{4}, \frac{7 \pi}{4}, & 1 \text { mark for solving for } \cos \theta \\
& \theta=\frac{\pi}{4}+\pi k \\
& =\frac{3 \pi}{4}+\pi k
\end{array}\right\} \begin{aligned}
& 1 \text { mark for values of } \theta \\
& \left(\frac{1}{2} \text { mark for each branch }\right)
\end{aligned}
\]

