Solve \(\sec \theta+2=0\) over the interval \([0,2 \pi]\).

\section*{Solution}
\[
\begin{aligned}
\sec \theta+2 & =0 \\
\sec \theta & =-2 \\
\cos \theta & =-\frac{1}{2} \\
\theta & =\frac{2 \pi}{3}, \frac{4 \pi}{3}
\end{aligned}
\]

